sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as React App
    participant Camera as Browser Camera
    participant Canvas as ASCII Canvas
    participant Service as Gemini Service
    participant Gemini as Google Gemini API
    User->>UI: Open application
    UI->>Camera: Request camera permission
    Camera-->>Canvas: Video stream if permitted
    loop Animation frames
        Canvas->>Canvas: Draw mirrored frame
        Canvas->>Canvas: Smooth pixels and map brightness
        Canvas-->>User: Render ASCII view
    end
    User->>Canvas: Click Scan and Analyze
    Canvas->>Canvas: Export visible canvas as PNG
    Canvas->>UI: onCapture(imageData)
    UI->>Service: analyzeImage(imageData)
    Service->>Gemini: Send image and JSON schema
    Gemini-->>Service: JSON text
    Service-->>UI: description, threatLevel, tags
    UI-->>User: Display analysis modal
